<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Cooperative Framework: Harvest, Maintenance &amp; Digital Tracks | Living Lab Portal</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #0f172a;
            --card: #1e293b;
            --txt: #f8fafc;
            --primary: #27ae60;
            --primary-dark: #1e8449;
            --hud: #144d29;
            --accent: #38bdf8;
            --muted: #94a3b8;
            --border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }

        body {
            font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
            background: var(--bg);
            color: var(--txt);
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 30px auto;
            background: var(--card);
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 40px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        }

        .hud-bar {
            background: var(--hud);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 10px 18px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        h1 {
            color: #4ade80;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            margin-top: 0;
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border);
            padding-bottom: 15px;
        }

        h2 {
            color: var(--accent);
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            margin-top: 30px;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
            padding-left: 10px;
        }

        p, li {
            color: var(--muted);
        }

        strong {
            color: var(--txt);
        }

        .agreement-section {
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.5);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 22px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }

        ul {
            padding-left: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }

        .action-container {
            margin-top: 40px;
            padding-top: 25px;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: var(--primary);
            color: #fff;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: bold;
            cursor: pointer;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: background 0.2s;
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            background: var(--primary-dark);
        }

        .btn-secondary {
            background: #334155;
            color: var(--txt);
            padding: 12px 20px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .btn-secondary:hover {
            background: #475569;
        }

        .success-banner {
            display: none;
            background: rgba(39, 174, 96, 0.2);
            border: 1px solid var(--primary);
            color: #4ade80;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-top: 20px;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-align: center;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <div class="hud-bar">
        <span>Framework: <span style="color:var(--accent);">Integrated Cell Operations &amp; Digital Tracks</span></span>
        <div>Global XP Ledger: <span id="global-points" style="color:#4ade80;">400</span></div>
    </div>

    <h1>Cooperative Harvest, Maintenance &amp; Digital Package</h1>
    <p>This integrated agreement binds cell members across all operational waves to mutual standards of upkeep, data logging, immediate systems/labor profitability, and digital market expansion.</p>

    <!-- SECTION 1 -->
    <div class="agreement-section">
        <h2>1. The Maintenance &amp; Telemetry Commitment ("Sweat Equity")</h2>
        <p>To preserve long-term soil health, ensure regulatory compliance, and maintain valid research data for academic extension partners, all participants agree to:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Routine Data Logging:</strong> Complete required metric entries (soil moisture, telemetry, labor hours) using portal standards (e.g., Module 203 framework).</li>
            <li><strong>Upkeep Protocol:</strong> Dedicate baseline hours weekly to plot maintenance, equipment safeguarding, and environmental monitoring.</li>
            <li><strong>Cell Integrity:</strong> Ensure that when cells reach capacity and execute a structural split, all baseline logs and historical plot tracking transfer seamlessly to the new sub-cell leadership.</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- SECTION 2 -->
    <div class="agreement-section">
        <h2>2. Immediate Profitability via Systems &amp; Labor Contracts</h2>
        <p>To establish early cash flow prior to crop yields, cells leverage operational expertise out of the gate:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Contract Execution:</strong> Deploying skilled recruits and stewards to fulfill specialized regional soil telemetry, equipment operation, or conservation maintenance contracts.</li>
            <li><strong>Reinvestment:</strong> Directing immediate labor contract earnings back into cell liquidity and operational scaling.</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- SECTION 3 -->
    <div class="agreement-section">
        <h2>3. Digital Sales, Processing Tracks &amp; Value-Add Percentages</h2>
        <p>Bridging traditional grower wisdom with modern digital prowess to maximize market returns:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>The Generational Bridge:</strong> While senior stewards manage land, farm stands, and traditional growing wisdom, the tech/sales crew manages online e-commerce pipelines, digital pre-orders, and value-added processing tracks.</li>
            <li><strong>Handling &amp; Market Commission:</strong> To sustain the tech infrastructure and logistics, a modest handling percentage (e.g., 10–15%) is allocated from digital and value-added processing sales to the tech/sales crew, with the bulk of proceeds returned directly to the grower and cell.</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- SECTION 4 -->
    <div class="agreement-section">
        <h2>4. Shared Harvest Allocation &amp; Benefit Distribution</h2>
        <p>To eliminate disputes and ensure equitable returns, the distribution of surplus harvest, revenue, and contract gains is calculated transparently:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Ledger-Based Equity:</strong> Shares are allocated dynamically based on verified maintenance hours logged, systems contracts fulfilled, and active participation points (XP).</li>
            <li><strong>Transparent Auditing:</strong> The platform records all contributions automatically, providing an audit-ready report for cell members and grant committees alike.</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div id="acknowledgment-banner" class="success-banner">
        ✓ Agreement Digitally Acknowledged &amp; Logged to Your Portfolio Ledger (+50 XP Earned!)
    </div>

    <!-- FOOTER NAV -->
    <div class="action-container">
        <a href="index.html" class="btn-secondary">🏠 Return to Hub</a>
        <button onclick="acknowledgeAgreement()" class="btn-primary">Acknowledge &amp; Sign Framework →</button>
    </div>
</div>

<script>
    document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", () => {
        const xp = localStorage.getItem('afti_global_xp') || '400';
        document.getElementById('global-points').innerText = xp;
    });

    function acknowledgeAgreement() {
        let currentXP = parseInt(localStorage.getItem('afti_global_xp') || '400', 10) + 50;
        localStorage.setItem('afti_global_xp', currentXP);
        document.getElementById('global-points').innerText = currentXP;

        document.getElementById('acknowledgment-banner').style.display = 'block';
        
        const btn = document.querySelector('.btn-primary');
        btn.innerText = "Framework Signed & Verified";
        btn.style.background = "#334155";
        btn.style.cursor = "default";
        btn.onclick = null;
    }
</script>

</body>
</html>
